OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, the rain occasionally heavy.
OL,7,FSome drier and brighter spells
OL,8,Fpossible and winds will be light from
OL,9,Fthe west or southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain possible at
OL,12,Ffirst this evening, mainly to the
OL,13,Fsouth and east of Glasgow, but soon
OL,14,Fmainly dry. Clear spells developing
OL,15,Fand rather chilly by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells, but cloud building with
OL,19,Foccasional heavy showers. Drier and
OL,20,Fbrighter again later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
